  ('vacancies', 'Vacancies', 'Welcome to the thriving and inspiring world of careers at Kampala Junior School, where dedication and passion come together to nurture the next generation of leaders. Our committed team of [&hellip;]', '<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Welcome to the thriving and inspiring world of careers at Kampala Junior School, where dedication and passion come together to nurture the next generation of leaders. Our committed team of educators at both nursery school and primary school levels creates a dynamic learning environment that sparks curiosity and a lifelong love of learning.</p>



<div style="height:39px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At Kampala Junior School, we believe in the transformative power of early childhood education and primary learning within an inclusive and supportive community. We prioritize hiring educators who bring not only outstanding teaching skills but also creativity and innovation to the classroom. We understand that quality education goes beyond textbooks, and we encourage our staff to infuse their unique talents and ideas, enabling students to explore, question, and discover with enthusiasm.</p>



<div style="height:45px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Diversity is at the heart of our school culture, and we seek educators who contribute to the rich mosaic of experiences that make Kampala Junior School a truly special place for learners.</p>



<div style="height:41px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Becoming part of our team means joining a collaborative and supportive family dedicated to professional growth. Whether you are an experienced teacher or a recent graduate passionate about making a difference, Kampala Junior School offers a platform to inspire young minds and impact Uganda’s educational future.</p>



<div style="height:47px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We invest deeply in our educators’ development through regular workshops, seminars, and mentorship programs, ensuring they stay current with the latest teaching methods and educational technology. This commitment to ongoing training helps our teachers thrive and maintain the high standards that define our school.</p>



<div style="height:41px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="has-link-color wp-elements-1 wp-block-paragraph">If you’re ready to build a rewarding career in our daycare, nursery school or primary school, please send your CV and supporting documents to <strong>info@kja.ug.</strong></p>



<p class="has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-paragraph"></p>', 'https://kja.ug/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/1711534840485DSC_0716.jpg', 'Mukisa-KJA', '2025-09-22T02:26:55', 'Welcome to the thriving and inspiring world of careers at Kampala Junior School, where dedication and passion come together to nurture the next generation of leaders. Our committed team of [&hellip;]'),
  ('visit-us', 'Visit us', 'At the heart of every child’s educational journey lies the vital decision of choosing the right school. At Kampala Junior Academy, we recognize how important it is for families to [&hellip;]', '<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At the heart of every child’s educational journey lies the vital decision of choosing the right school. At Kampala Junior Academy, we recognize how important it is for families to find an institution that reflects their values, supports holistic development, and provides a nurturing, inspiring environment.</p>



<div style="height:44px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We warmly invite you to visit any of our campuses and discover what makes our approach to early childhood education truly exceptional:<br>➢ Bunga – Nursery School.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">➢ Makindye – Nursery School.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">➢ Kitante – Nursery School & Primary School.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">➢ Najjanankumbi – Nursery School & Primary School.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">➢ Ntinda – Daycare & Nursery School.</p>



<div style="height:48px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1080" height="537" src="http://84.247.190.131/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/1719399720843-72945312_117965202952248_1063534516393476096_n.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-473"/></figure>



<div style="height:45px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Whether you''re looking for a vibrant and caring daycare, nursery school or a strong foundation in a primary school, Kampala Junior Academy offers the perfect setting for your child’s early years. Our campuses are designed to promote curiosity, confidence, and creativity — all essential components of a well-rounded education.</p>



<div style="height:44px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">By visiting, you’ll experience firsthand the warmth and excellence that define our learning spaces. Our classrooms and outdoor areas are intentionally designed to support developmentally appropriate activities that encourage exploration, problem-solving, and joyful learning — the core of early learning.</p>



<div style="height:36px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Meeting our dedicated educators is a key part of your visit.</p>



<div style="height:35px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At Kampala Junior Academy, our teachers are more than instructors — they are mentors who guide each child with compassion, knowledge, and personalized attention. They work in close partnership with families to nurture the academic, emotional, and social growth of every learner.</p>



<div style="height:38px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">To help us make your visit personal and meaningful, we encourage you to visit our campuses. This ensures we can take the time to answer your questions, give you a tailored tour, and help you understand how our programs — from daycare through nursery school to primary school can support your child’s development.</p>



<div style="height:35px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Choosing the right school is a significant step toward your child’s bright future. We invite you to explore our campuses and see how Kampala Junior Academy stands out as a leader in early childhood education.</p>



<div style="height:41px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Let’s walk this exciting journey together — nurturing young minds and shaping the Future Leaders of tomorrow.</p>



<div style="height:36px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="has-link-color wp-elements-7 wp-block-paragraph">To begin your child’s enrollment, simply <a href="http://84.247.190.131/apply/" data-type="page" data-id="235" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>click here to apply online</strong></a>.<br>We can’t wait to welcome you to the KJA family!</p>', 'https://kja.ug/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG-20251020-WA0157.jpg', 'Mukisa-KJA', '2025-09-22T02:19:30', 'At the heart of every child’s educational journey lies the vital decision of choosing the right school. At Kampala Junior Academy, we recognize how important it is for families to [&hellip;]'),
