<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Arts & Crafts</strong>.</h3>



<div style="height:33px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Available at:</strong> KJA Kitante & Najjanankumbi.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Meeting day & time:</strong> To be announced.</p>



<div style="height:41px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At KJA, the Arts & Crafts Club offers fun activities like painting, drawing, sketching, and crafting for nursery school and primary learners. This creative space encourages children to explore their passions and develop their talents in a warm, supportive setting. Kids also get the chance to collaborate and share ideas with other young artists, making learning together a joyful part of their early childhood education.</p>



<div style="height:36px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Computer.</h3>



<div style="height:29px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Available at:</strong> KJA Kitante & Najjanankumbi.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Meeting day & time:</strong> To be announced.</p>



<div style="height:38px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our Computer Club develops computer skills to boost students’ thinking and problem-solving abilities. Open to primary school students and above, this club introduces coding, mechanics, and technology, helping children build valuable STEM skills. These skills not only support academic growth but also prepare students for exciting future careers in science and technology.</p>



<div style="height:42px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



