<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Home Management.</h3>



<div style="height:31px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Available at:</strong> KJA Kitante & Najjanankumbi.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Meeting day & time:</strong> To be announced.</p>



<div style="height:37px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The Home Management Club teaches important life skills like time management, organization, cooking, cleaning, laundry, sewing, and budgeting. Designed for primary school children, it helps students balance their responsibilities both at home and at school. This club aims to empower children with practical skills they’ll use throughout their lives, supporting their overall development in early childhood education and beyond.</p>



<div style="height:44px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Talent UG.</h3>



<div style="height:30px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Available at:</strong> KJA Kitante & Najjanankumbi.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Meeting day & time:</strong> To be announced.</p>



<div style="height:37px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Talent Ug is a vibrant club at KJA for nursery and primary where children can celebrate and showcase their unique talents. This club creates a supportive and collaborative environment that encourages students in their early childhood education journey to grow and push their limits. By working together, members aim to shine brightly and redefine what’s possible in talent representation, helping to build confidence and creativity from an early age.</p>



<div style="height:83px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="has-link-color wp-elements-10 wp-block-paragraph">To begin your child’s enrollment, simply <a href="https://www.kja.ug/#/apply" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>click here to apply online</strong></a>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We can’t wait to welcome you to the KJA family!</p>



