  ('music', 'Music & Dance', 'Ballet. Available at: All KJA Branches. Meeting day & time: To be announced. Ballet Club allows students across daycare, nursery school, and primary school levels to improve their coordination, flexibility, and gracefulness while [&hellip;]', '<div style="height:31px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Ballet</strong>.</h3>



<div style="height:34px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Available at: </strong>All KJA Branches.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Meeting day & time: </strong>To be announced.</p>



<div style="height:39px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Ballet Club allows students across daycare, nursery school, and primary school levels to improve their coordination, flexibility, and gracefulness while also fostering discipline and dedication. Ballet club provides a supportive environment for children in early childhood education to express themselves creatively and build confidence in their abilities.</p>



<div style="height:41px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Guitar</strong>.</h3>



<div style="height:40px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Available at:</strong> KJA Kitante & Najjanankumbi.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Meeting day & time:</strong> To be announced.</p>



<div style="height:34px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Guitar Club welcomes students from primary school levels, providing a supportive environment for beginners to learn basic chords and techniques, while also offering more advanced players the opportunity to collaborate and improve their skills. Through regular meetings and performances, students can build confidence and a sense of solidarity with their peers who share a passion for music.</p>



<div style="height:46px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Piano.</h3>



<div style="height:32px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Available at:</strong> KJA Kitante & Najjanankumbi.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Meeting day & time:</strong> To be announced.</p>



<div style="height:32px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Piano Club offers students in primary school a chance to showcase their talents through lessons and performances, fostering a sense of support among members. Additionally, piano club offers workshops and masterclasses to enhance students'' skills and knowledge in piano playing, contributing to their overall early childhood education development.</p>



<div style="height:52px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



