  ('sports', 'Games & Sports', 'Badminton. Available at: KJA Kitante & Najjanankumbi. Meeting day & time:To be announced. The Badminton Club at our primary school campuses is a fun and active way for students to improve physical [&hellip;]', '<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Badminton</strong>.</h3>



<div style="height:37px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Available at: </strong>KJA<strong> </strong>Kitante & Najjanankumbi.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Meeting day & time:</strong>To be announced.</p>



<div style="height:43px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The Badminton Club at our primary school campuses is a fun and active way for students to improve physical health while learning essential life skills like teamwork, discipline, and resilience. Whether your child is in early childhood education or primary school, playing badminton helps build strong group values and confidence that last beyond the court.</p>



<div style="height:55px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Chess</strong>.</h3>



<div style="height:33px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Available at: </strong>KJA Makindye, Ntinda, Kitante & Najjanankumbi.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Meeting day & time: </strong>To be announced.</p>



<div style="height:35px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our Scouts Club is open to all primary school children who are eager to learn life skills and serve their communities. By participating in Scouts, children can learn valuable skills such as teamwork, problem-solving, life skills, build lasting friendships. and communication. These experiences can help them grow into confident and capable individuals who are prepared for the challenges of the future. Scouts are encouraged to participate in community and international service projects to develop leadership skills and teamwork, and make a positive impact on the world around them. This club offers fun ways to build courage, compassion, and curiosity, all important values in early childhood education. </p>



<div style="height:47px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



