<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Swimming.</h3>



<div style="height:30px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Available at:</strong>All KJA Campuses.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Meeting day & time:</strong>To be announced.</p>



<div style="height:44px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Swimming Club is open to children at all levels from daycare, nursery school to primary school focusing on water safety, fitness, and healthy living. Students can join swim meets and competitions, progressing from beginner lessons to competitive swimming. KJA has proudly produced top swimmers like Tendo Mukalazi, Paulsen Settumba, and Kirabo Namutebi, reflecting our strong commitment to early childhood education and physical development.</p>



<div style="height:49px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Talent X-tra Soccer</strong>.</h3>



<div style="height:34px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Available at:</strong>KJA Kitante.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Meeting day & time:</strong>To be announced.</p>



<div style="height:40px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Talent X-tra Soccer Club at our primary school campus is dedicated to discovering and nurturing future soccer stars. With skilled coaches recognized by the Uganda Youth Football Association, this club supports children from early childhood education through primary school in developing their football skills. Through exciting events and competitions, students gain confidence, teamwork skills, and the chance to shine on and off the field.</p>



<div style="height:38px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="has-link-color wp-elements-25 wp-block-paragraph">To begin your child’s enrollment, simply <a href="http://84.247.190.131/apply/" data-type="page" data-id="235" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>click here to apply online</strong></a>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We can’t wait to welcome you to the KJA family!</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>', 'https://kja.ug/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/1748605345079-DSC_0031.jpg', 'Mukisa-KJA', '2025-08-03T18:01:19', 'Badminton. Available at: KJA Kitante &amp; Najjanankumbi. Meeting day &amp; time:To be announced. The Badminton Club at our&nbsp;primary school&nbsp;campuses is a fun and active way for students to improve physical [&hellip;]'),
  ('leadership', 'Young Hearts, Big Impact: Growing Leaders Through Service at KJA', 'At Kampala Junior Academy, leadership and service are not just ideals — they are lived values rooted in our daily practice. From the earliest stages of early childhood education through [&hellip;]', '<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At Kampala Junior Academy, leadership and service are not just ideals — they are lived values rooted in our daily practice. From the earliest stages of early childhood education through to primary school, we instill in our learners a deep understanding that true leadership is grounded in service to others. Through structured leadership opportunities and a nurturing environment, we empower students to become responsible, visionary individuals ready to lead with compassion and integrity.</p>



<div style="height:47px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">School Prefects: Fostering Responsibility and Accountability</h3>



<div style="height:45px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our prefect system is an integral part of student life. Through democratic elections, primary school learners are given the chance to take on leadership roles that promote responsibility and self-discipline. Prefects are chosen by both peers and teachers, and they serve as role models who exemplify our values of accountability, service, and excellence. These roles cultivate leadership qualities from an early age, aligning with our mission to nurture future leaders.</p>



<div style="height:36px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Club Leaders: Nurturing Passionate Visionaries.</h3>



<div style="height:36px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our vibrant co-curricular environment includes a variety of student-led clubs, from science and literature to sports and the performing arts. Club leaders are students who demonstrate initiative, creativity, and a passion for engaging others. These opportunities help learners develop confidence, teamwork, and communication skills — all essential for leadership and lifelong learning, especially during the critical stages of early learning and development.</p>



<div style="height:40px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



