<div style="height:53px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Swimming: Dive into Excellence</h3>



<div style="height:39px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our swimming program is open to students across all levels, including daycare, preschool, and primary school, helping them gain water confidence, learn proper techniques, and even train for national school competitions. Taught by certified coaches, it builds lifelong skills in water safety and fitness, promoting both physical and mental strength from an early age.</p>



<div style="height:47px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Football: The Beautiful Game, The Beautiful Journey.</h3>



<div style="height:40px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Through our partnership with Talent Xtra Sports Club, fully registered under FUFA Youth Football, our football program helps learners in nursery school, preschool, and primary school build both technical football skills and important life values. Through friendly games and tournaments, children develop collaboration, leadership, and sportsmanship — while having fun doing it.</p>



<div style="height:46px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Athletics: Run, Jump, Soar.</h3>



<div style="height:29px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our athletics program nurtures champions from the ground up. Students, including those in primary school, participate in track and field events that push them to explore their personal strengths and develop physical stamina and mental resilience. Whether it’s running, jumping, or throwing, athletics becomes a journey of self-belief and perseverance.</p>



<div style="height:35px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Net Games: Aces and Volleys.</h3>



<div style="height:29px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At Kampala Junior Academy, net games like badminton are introduced to children from an early age. Certified coaches guide students in building hand-eye coordination, strategy, and fair play. This fun and active sport promotes quick thinking and healthy competition among learners of all levels.</p>



<div style="height:62px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In all of these activities, we strive to ensure that sports and extracurricular life are integrated into our philosophy of early childhood education. Whether in a classroom or on the field, nursery school to primary school, we create an environment where every child’s potential is nurtured and celebrated.</p>



<div style="height:68px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="has-link-color wp-elements-31 wp-block-paragraph">To begin your child’s enrollment, simply <a href="http://84.247.190.131/apply/" data-type="page" data-id="235" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>click here to apply online</strong></a>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We can’t wait to welcome you to the KJA family!</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>', 'https://kja.ug/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/1748608283163-1719398819848-72722615_110114777070624_990082256280223744_n-copy.jpg', 'Mukisa-KJA', '2025-08-03T17:34:11', 'In the ever-evolving world of education, Kampala Junior Academy shines as a beacon of holistic growth, deeply rooted in a commitment to early childhood education and beyond. We understand that [&hellip;]'),
  ('arts', 'Voices, Rhythm, and Grace: Shaping Confident Learners Through Performing Arts', 'At Kampala Junior Academy, we believe education is more than just books — it’s about nurturing the whole child from early childhood education through primary school. We understand how important [&hellip;]', '<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At Kampala Junior Academy, we believe education is more than just books — it’s about nurturing the whole child from early childhood education through primary school. We understand how important creativity and cultural awareness are in shaping young minds, and that’s why our preschool and primary programs shine as places where the arts and culture come alive.</p>



<div style="height:58px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Celebrating the Arts</strong>.</h3>



<div style="height:34px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We know that the arts are a powerful way for children in early childhood education and beyond to express themselves, discover who they are, and grow emotionally. Our performing arts program gives every student—from nursery school through primary school—the chance to explore their creative side — whether it’s through music, drama, dance, or visual arts. We celebrate all kinds of artistic expression and encourage every child to find their own special voice.</p>



<div style="height:47px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Music: Finding Your Own Beat</strong></h3>



<div style="height:28px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In our music studios, students learn to play different instruments and appreciate the beauty of harmonies. From traditional songs to modern beats, our music lessons cover many styles so every child—from daycare, preschool, to primary school—can connect with sound and rhythm. With passionate teachers and group performances, students build not only musical talent but also teamwork and friendship.</p>



<div style="height:36px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Drama: Telling Stories and Building Confidence</strong>.</h3>



<div style="height:28px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The stage is a place where stories come alive and confidence grows. Our MDD program helps students from early childhood education through primary school bring stories to life through acting, improvisation, and plays. Beyond performing, drama teaches children to communicate well, understand others, and be brave in sharing their ideas.</p>



<div style="height:32px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Dance: Moving with Culture and Joy</strong>.</h3>



<div style="height:33px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Dance is a language everyone understands. Our dance program takes students on a journey through different styles—from traditional African dances to ballet and contemporary moves. Dance keeps children active while helping them appreciate the beauty of different cultures and traditions across all levels, including nursery school and primary levels.</p>



<div style="height:31px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Visual Arts: Bringing Imagination to Life</strong>.</h3>



<div style="height:29px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In our art rooms, children from preschool to primary school explore painting, drawing, sculpture, and even digital design. They learn to see the world with fresh eyes and turn their ideas into real works of art. Creating art boosts their confidence and pride, as they express feelings and stories through colours and shapes.</p>



<div style="height:43px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



