<div style="height:33px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Mathematics: Growing Our Thinking and Problem-Solving Skills</strong></h4>



<div style="height:26px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In mathematics, we build a strong foundation in logical reasoning and problem-solving for learners across early childhood education up to primary school. Our curriculum, guided by national standards, covers essential topics like sets, graphs, measurements, and geometry. Engaging lessons and collaborative challenges help students master mathematical concepts that prepare them for future academic and professional success.</p>



<div style="height:26px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Social Studies: Discovering Our Roots and Community</strong></h4>



<div style="height:26px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At Kampala Junior Academy, Social Studies classes offer immersive experiences that deepen students’ understanding of cultures, history, and society. Our curriculum encourages learners in preschool and primary school to develop empathy, cultural awareness, and civic responsibility through the study of history, civics, and environmental conservation.</p>



<div style="height:30px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Religious Education: Nurturing Values and Good Values</strong></h4>



<div style="height:26px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our religious education program fosters respect for diversity and freedom of belief, nurturing students’ understanding of various faiths. It supports learners in early childhood education and beyond to appreciate cultural and ethical dimensions of different religions, promoting tolerance and respect within our school community.</p>



<div style="height:26px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>English Literacy & Comprehension: Mastering the Art of Communication</strong></h4>



<div style="height:36px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">English literacy is a cornerstone of effective communication and critical thinking across all KJA levels. From nursery school to primary school, students engage with a rich variety of texts—from classic literature to modern works—enhancing their reading, writing, and oral skills in an encouraging environment.</p>



<div style="height:32px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Information and Communications Technology (ICT)</strong></h4>



<div style="height:25px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our ICT program introduces digital literacy early, supporting students through primary school. Children learn essential computer skills, use educational software, and develop problem-solving abilities that prepare them for a technology-driven future, empowering their digital knowledge from an early age.</p>



<div style="height:27px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Other Languages: Opening Doors to New Cultures and Voices</strong></h4>



<div style="height:28px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In our commitment to global awareness, we offer language programs including French, Kiswahili, and Chinese. Students across preschool and primary school enjoy these opportunities to embrace linguistic diversity, opening doors to international communication and cultural exchange.</p>



<div style="height:35px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Alongside academics, KJA offers vibrant co-curricular clubs in French, computers, arts and crafts, and more to enrich early childhood education and primary learning experiences.</p>



<div style="height:37px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At the heart of our success are our certified, experienced, and compassionate teachers dedicated to nurturing the whole child. Our educators serve not only as instructors but also as mentors who inspire a lifelong love of learning from nursery school through primary school.</p>



<div style="height:55px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In conclusion, Kampala Junior Academy is more than just an educational institution. It is a dynamic hub of academic exploration and holistic learning. By strictly adhering to national guidelines and approved curricula, we ensure students receive a well-rounded education that prepares them for the challenges of today’s world. Through diverse subjects and supportive teaching, we empower our learners in early childhood education and beyond to excel academically, develop valuable life skills, and embrace curiosity for a rapidly changing global landscape.</p>



<div style="height:44px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="has-link-color wp-elements-37 wp-block-paragraph">To begin your child’s enrollment, simply <a href="http://84.247.190.131/apply/" data-type="page" data-id="235" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>click here to apply online</strong></a>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We can’t wait to welcome you to the KJA family!</p>



