<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At Kampala Junior Academy, we value the trust you place in us and understand that investing in your child''s education is an important decision. Whether you’re enrolling your child in nursery school or primary school, we are here to support you every step of the way.</p>



<div style="height:27px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



