<h2 class="wp-block-heading">🎓 Age & Grade Placement:</h2>



<div style="height:19px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We take a thoughtful approach to placing children in the right grade. Age, previous school experience, and academic readiness are all considered to ensure learners are supported and challenged appropriately.</p>



<div style="height:22px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">For new pupils, we may request:</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">✹ Previous school transcripts.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">✹ A short assessment or placement test (Primary).</p>



<div style="height:25px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">This ensures your child is placed in a grade level that matches their abilities and gives them the best chance to succeed.</p>



<div style="height:46px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



