<div style="height:34px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Families have two options:</p>



<div style="height:20px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading">➢ Online application form.</h4>



<div style="height:9px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A quick and convenient way to express interest in the nursery school or primary school enrollment.<br><a href="/kja/admissions/" data-type="page" data-id="93" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Click here to apply online</a></p>



<div style="height:23px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading">➢ In-person.</h4>



<div style="height:12px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"> Visit one of our campuses for a more personalized experience</p>



<div style="height:24px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Please note:</strong> Completion of the admission process requires a visit to the school. We value the chance to meet you and your child, and for you to see firsthand the welcoming and dynamic learning environment we’ve built at KJA.</p>



<div style="height:33px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading">🎓 Why Visit Us?</h2>



<div style="height:36px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">During your visit, you’ll:</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">✹ Meet our friendly and experienced teachers.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">✹ Tour our learning spaces, playgrounds, and classrooms.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">✹ Discover how our focus on early childhood education supports confident, happy learners.</p>



<div style="height:27px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At Kampala Junior Academy, our open admissions policy is more than just flexibility — it’s a commitment to diversity, accessibility, and giving each child a strong educational foundation from nursery school to primary school.</p>



<div style="height:27px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We recognize that every child is unique, and we are here to walk with you every step of the way — from the first day of preschool to the final Primary Seven exam.</p>



<div style="height:20px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading wp-elements-43">🎓<a href="https://www.kja.ug/#/apply" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Enroll today and let your child thrive with us!</a></h4>



<div style="height:22px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="has-link-color wp-elements-44 wp-block-paragraph">To begin your child’s enrollment, simply <a href="http://84.247.190.131/apply/" data-type="page" data-id="235" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>click here to apply online</strong></a>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We can’t wait to welcome you to the KJA family!</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>', 'https://kja.ug/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/171025183268018319503-7AFB-4DB8-8434-AA473AE45521.png', 'Mukisa-KJA', '2025-08-03T11:30:33', 'At Kampala Junior Academy, we believe that every child deserves the opportunity to learn, grow, and thrive. That’s why we proudly follow an open admissions policy — inviting learners from [&hellip;]'),
  ('about-us', 'About us', 'Kampala Junior Academy (KJA) is one of the leading private schools in Uganda, offering nursery school, daycare, and primary school education since 1993. The school was founded by Mrs Mary [&hellip;]', '<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Kampala Junior Academy (KJA) is one of the leading private schools in Uganda, offering nursery school, daycare, and primary school education since 1993.</p>



<div style="height:28px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The school was founded by Mrs Mary Mulumba, a dedicated teacher with over 60 years in the field of early childhood education. From the beginning, her dream was clear — to give young learners a strong start in life through quality, caring, holistic and child friendly education.</p>



<div style="height:25px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Vision</h2>



<div style="height:17px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">To be an inclusive school that has high aspirations for every child, to create a well facilitated institution that is capable of shaping children into future responsible leaders.</p>



<div style="height:35px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Mission</h2>



<div style="height:24px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">To give learners the best possible head start on their academic careers by encouraging their natural inquisitiveness, creativity and motivation to learn.</p>



<div style="height:60px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<figure class="wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-24 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border is-style-default"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1080" height="719" data-id="581" src="https://kja.ug/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG-20251003-WA0067.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-581" style="border-radius:23px"/></figure>
</figure>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<figure class="wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-25 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" data-id="85" src="https://kja.ug/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/1729770384619-7778.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-85" style="border-radius:23px"/></figure>
</figure>
</div>
</div>



<div style="height:43px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We started humbly, with only a Nursery Section at Clement Hill Road, focusing on the youngest children in our care. Our daycare and preschool programs helped parents feel supported, knowing their little ones were in safe hands. By 1997, we had grown to open our Primary section, and in 2003, we proudly saw our first P7 pupils sit for their Primary Leaving Exams (PLE).</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Today, Kampala Junior Academy has five campuses across Kampala:</p>



<div style="height:24px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Kitante</li>



<li>Bunga</li>



<li>Makindye</li>



<li>Najjanankumbi</li>



<li>Ntinda.</li>
</ul>



<div style="height:48px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Each one provides a safe, nurturing space for learners at every stage — from daycare and nursery school, all the way to primary school. We believe in giving children the tools they need to succeed academically, socially, and personally. In 2021, we moved into the digital world by launching our online learning platform—so children can keep learning from home wherever they are.</p>



<div style="height:21px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our goal is to make quality early childhood education more accessible to families in Uganda and beyond. From our first steps in 1993 to our growth in primary education and our leap into online preschool and primary learning, KJA continues to stay committed to the success of every child.</p>



<div style="height:35px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We are proud of our journey and look forward to building more bright futures through excellent education, leaving an everlasting mark on Uganda''s educational environment.</p>



<div style="height:35px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="has-link-color wp-elements-49 wp-block-paragraph">To begin your child’s enrollment, simply <a href="http://84.247.190.131/apply/" data-type="page" data-id="235" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>click here to apply online</strong></a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We can’t wait to welcome you to the KJA family!</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>', 'https://kja.ug/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/1748603633817-1718272909284-897C155B-DD72-4603-ACAE-CFDDB7546469-1.png', 'Mukisa-KJA', '2025-08-03T11:07:39', 'Explore the Best Nursery and Primary School in Uganda, where quality education and caring experiences begin for young learners.'),
  ('from-the-director', 'From The Director', 'It is my great pleasure to welcome you to Kampala Junior Academy (KJA) — a school that has proudly provided daycare, nursery school, and primary school education to families in [&hellip;]', '<div style="height:31px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">It is my great pleasure to welcome you to Kampala Junior Academy (KJA) — a school that has proudly provided daycare, nursery school, and primary school education to families in Uganda since 1993.</p>



<div style="height:23px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I am honored to be part of a vibrant school community that is deeply committed to providing outstanding early childhood education for every child. At KJA, we believe that each learner is unique, with special talents, interests, and passions. Our role is to nurture those gifts by creating a warm, inclusive, and supportive learning environment.</p>



<div style="height:37px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We offer a child-centered and holistic approach to education that focuses on the whole child. Our programs are carefully designed to spark curiosity, build confidence, and inspire leadership — from our daycare and preschool learners, all the way to our primary school students.</p>



<div style="height:31px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our Nursery and Primary School curricula provide a strong foundation in academics while also helping children grow emotionally and socially. Learners are supported to master key subjects like English, Mathematics, Science, and Social Studies — essential skills for success in school and beyond.</p>



<div style="height:27px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">As children move through our school, they are introduced to a wide range of academic and co-curricular activities. These include sports, etiquette, foreign languages, art, and more — all designed to build well-rounded learners with confidence and creativity. Whether a child is in preschool or preparing for Primary Seven, we give them the tools to excel in the 21st century.</p>



<div style="height:36px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At KJA, we believe leadership begins early. That’s why our curriculum weaves leadership development into everyday learning — helping our students become confident decision-makers, team players, and future changemakers.</p>



<div style="height:32px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A strong partnership between home and school is key to a child’s success. We value your trust and are committed to working closely with you to support your child’s educational journey. Whether your child is just beginning their journey in our nursery school or daycare, or is progressing through primary school, we are here every step of the way.</p>



<div style="height:20px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Thank you for choosing Kampala Junior Academy. We are excited to welcome you into our community and to walk with you as we help your child grow, dream, and succeed. Together, we are shaping the leaders of tomorrow.</p>



<div style="height:29px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Warm regards,<br>Andrew Mulumba<br><em>Director, Kampala Junior Academy Schools</em></strong></p>', 'https://kja.ug/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/1727089882239-DSC_0231-4.jpg', 'Mukisa-KJA', '2025-08-03T10:40:56', 'It is my great pleasure to welcome you to Kampala Junior Academy (KJA) — a school that has proudly provided daycare, nursery school, and primary school education to families in [&hellip;]'),
  ('privacy-policy', 'Privacy Policy', 'Who we are Suggested text: Our website address is: http://84.247.190.131. Comments Suggested text: When visitors leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, and [&hellip;]', '<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Who we are</h2>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong class="privacy-policy-tutorial">Suggested text: </strong>Our website address is: http://84.247.190.131.</p>


<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Comments</h2>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong class="privacy-policy-tutorial">Suggested text: </strong>When visitors leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, and also the visitor''s IP address and browser user agent string to help spam detection.</p>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph">An anonymized string created from your email address (also called a hash) may be provided to the Gravatar service to see if you are using it. The Gravatar service privacy policy is available here: https://automattic.com/privacy/. After approval of your comment, your profile picture is visible to the public in the context of your comment.</p>


<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Media</h2>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong class="privacy-policy-tutorial">Suggested text: </strong>If you upload images to the website, you should avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS) included. Visitors to the website can download and extract any location data from images on the website.</p>


<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Cookies</h2>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong class="privacy-policy-tutorial">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment on our site you may opt-in to saving your name, email address and website in cookies. These are for your convenience so that you do not have to fill in your details again when you leave another comment. These cookies will last for one year.</p>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph">If you visit our login page, we will set a temporary cookie to determine if your browser accepts cookies. This cookie contains no personal data and is discarded when you close your browser.</p>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph">When you log in, we will also set up several cookies to save your login information and your screen display choices. Login cookies last for two days, and screen options cookies last for a year. If you select &quot;Remember Me&quot;, your login will persist for two weeks. If you log out of your account, the login cookies will be removed.</p>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph">If you edit or publish an article, an additional cookie will be saved in your browser. This cookie includes no personal data and simply indicates the post ID of the article you just edited. It expires after 1 day.</p>


<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Embedded content from other websites</h2>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong class="privacy-policy-tutorial">Suggested text: </strong>Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, articles, etc.). Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.</p>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph">These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have an account and are logged in to that website.</p>


<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Who we share your data with</h2>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong class="privacy-policy-tutorial">Suggested text: </strong>If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email.</p>


<h2 class="wp-block-heading">How long we retain your data</h2>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong class="privacy-policy-tutorial">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. This is so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a moderation queue.</p>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph">For users that register on our website (if any), we also store the personal information they provide in their user profile. All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except they cannot change their username). Website administrators can also see and edit that information.</p>


<h2 class="wp-block-heading">What rights you have over your data</h2>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong class="privacy-policy-tutorial">Suggested text: </strong>If you have an account on this site, or have left comments, you can request to receive an exported file of the personal data we hold about you, including any data you have provided to us. You can also request that we erase any personal data we hold about you. This does not include any data we are obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes.</p>


<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Where your data is sent</h2>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong class="privacy-policy-tutorial">Suggested text: </strong>Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service.</p>', null, 'Mukisa-KJA', '2025-07-12T17:40:27', 'Who we are Suggested text: Our website address is: http://84.247.190.131. Comments Suggested text: When visitors leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, and [&hellip;]');


insert into public.campuses (slug, title, excerpt, body, image_url, seo_description) values
  ('bunga', 'Bunga', 'Our Bunga campus offers a safe, engaging, and nurturing environment where young learners can explore, learn, and grow. As a leading early childhood education center in Kampala, we provide a balanced and structured curriculum tailored for the early years, ensuring that every child receives the attention and support they need to thrive.', '<div style="height:34px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Hello! I’m Brenda Momanyi, the Head Teacher at Kampala Junior Academy Bunga Nursery School, a warm and welcoming Nursery School in Bunga located conveniently along <strong>Nadduli Road, between Stabex and ORYX Petrol Stations on Ggaba Road.</strong></p>



<div style="height:36px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our Bunga campus offers a safe, engaging, and nurturing environment where young learners can explore, learn, and grow. As a leading early childhood education center in Kampala, we provide a balanced and structured curriculum tailored for the early years, ensuring that every child receives the attention and support they need to thrive.</p>



<div style="height:39px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Clubs & Co-Curricular Activities – Discover, Explore, Shine</h3>



<div style="height:38px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At Kampala Junior Academy, we believe that education goes beyond the classroom. As we thoughtfully introduce new clubs, we are excited to currently offer <strong>swimming lessons </strong>that promote physical development, confidence, and water safety.</p>



<div style="height:44px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">This is just the beginning; We’re in the process of carefully vetting and introducing more enriching activities to help our students discover their talents, build new skills, and shine in every aspect of school life.</p>



<div style="height:33px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Age Groups & Classes – Bunga Nursery Campus</h3>



<div style="height:36px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We offer a range of grade levels designed to meet your child’s developmental needs:</p>



<div style="height:39px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading">➢<strong>Daycare (Under 3 Years):</strong></h5>



<div style="height:32px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A playful and safe environment where toddlers engage in fun activities that promote creativity and social interaction. Perfect for families seeking quality daycare in Bunga.</p>



<div style="height:33px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading">➢<strong>Reception Class (3–4 Years):</strong></h5>



<div style="height:25px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Introduces early literacy and numeracy through songs, stories, and hands-on play.</p>



<div style="height:25px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading">➢<strong>Intermediate Class (4-5 Years):</strong></h5>



<div style="height:30px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Encourages independence and problem-solving with engaging, child-centered learning activities.</p>



<div style="height:23px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading">➢<strong>Pre-Primary Class (5-6 Years):</strong></h5>



<div style="height:25px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Prepares children for Primary One, focusing on foundational academics and essential life skills.</p>



<div style="height:31px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Each level at KJA Bunga Nursery is designed to build confidence, curiosity, and a love for learning in every child.</p>



<div style="height:28px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1080" height="810" src="http://84.247.190.131/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/1727087620512-IMG_6571_2.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-233"/></figure>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1080" height="810" src="http://84.247.190.131/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/1727087623527-IMG_6559_2.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-234"/></figure>
</div>
</div>



<div style="height:45px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">School Fees – Bunga Nursery.</h3>



<div style="height:34px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At Kampala Junior Academy Bunga, we offer transparent and inclusive tuition:</p>



<div style="height:28px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">✹ Admission Fee: <strong>UGX 30,000</strong>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">✹ Nursery Tuition: <strong>UGX 1000,000</strong>.</p>



<div style="height:33px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">(<em>Tuition includes all scholastic materials, break tea, and lunch.</em>)</p>



<div style="height:56px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Learning Environment & Facilities</strong></h3>



<div style="height:30px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">✹ Playground.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">✹ Play/Toy room.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">✹ Individualized age group classrooms.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">✹ Restrooms.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">✹ Safe drop-off and pick-up areas.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">✹ Parking space.</p>



<div style="height:45px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Campus Culture</strong></h3>



<div style="height:39px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading">➢<strong> Teacher-to-student ratio</strong>.</h5>



<div style="height:27px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We maintain a <strong>1:7 teacher-to-child ratio</strong>, ensuring each child receives personalized attention and care. This small class size allows for meaningful interactions, close supervision, and tailored learning experiences.</p>



<div style="height:34px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading">➢ <strong>Celebrations & Special Theme Days</strong>.</h5>



<div style="height:24px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We make school fun and memorable by celebrating special moments throughout the year!</p>



<div style="height:25px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">▫︎ Birthday Celebrations bring joy to each child’s special day.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">▫︎ Cultural Days allow children to showcase their heritage and learn about others.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">▫︎ Spirit Days like Pajama Day, Color Day, and Casual Wear Day bring smiles and excitement to the school week.</p>



<div style="height:30px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading">➢ <strong>Weekly Morning Assemblies</strong>.</h5>



<div style="height:28px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Every Friday morning, the school gathers for a lively assembly filled with music, prayer, and positive energy. These sessions:</p>



<div style="height:30px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">▫︎ Highlight important weekly announcements.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">▫︎ Encourage children to lead songs, prayers, or short presentations.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">▫︎ Build confidence and public speaking skills in a nurturing setting.</p>



<div style="height:33px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At KJA Bunga Nursery School, our vibrant campus culture helps children feel seen, supported, and celebrated every step of the way.</p>



<div style="height:33px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading">➢ <strong>Safe School Environment</strong>.</h5>



<div style="height:29px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our school prioritizes the safety and well-being of every child. We have a secure sign-in and sign-out system to ensure that only authorized individuals can pick up students, providing peace of mind for parents. Our campus is also monitored by security services, ensuring a safe and protected environment throughout the day.</p>



<div style="height:34px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Admissions – Join the KJA Family</h3>



<div style="height:38px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We’re excited that you’re considering Kampala Junior Academy Bunga for your child’s early education. Here’s how to join our nurturing school community:</p>



