<p class="wp-block-paragraph">▫︎ Copy of parent/guardian’s ID.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">▫︎ Copy of child’s immunization card.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">▫︎ Two passport-size photos.</p>



<div style="height:31px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading">✹ <strong>Submission</strong>.</h5>



<div style="height:28px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Submit your documents at our Bunga Nursery or Kitante Main Campus.</p>



<div style="height:22px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading">✹ <strong>Interview/Orientation</strong>.</h5>



<div style="height:24px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



