  ('makindye', 'Makindye', 'At KJA Makindye, we create a safe, welcoming, and stimulating environment where young children can explore, learn, and grow with confidence. Our dedicated teachers and nurturing atmosphere ensure that every day is filled with joy, discovery, and meaningful learning', '<h3 class="wp-block-heading">School Fees – Makindye Nursery Campus</h3>



