  ('najjanankumbi', 'Najjanankumbi', 'The Kampala Junior Academy – Najjanankumbi campus is our other blended nursery and primary school, located on serene Kaggwa Road off Kampala-Entebbe Road, just after Masanyalaze. It offers a warm and nurturing environment where young learners grow and thrive.', '<div style="height:40px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At Kampala Junior Academy – Najjanankumbi, we believe in providing more than just an education. We offer a nurturing environment where children feel safe, inspired, and supported to be their very best. From strong academics and vibrant co-curriculars to a caring community and a secure, scenic campus — everything at KJA is designed with your child’s growth in mind. If you''re looking for a school that combines quality nursery, daycare, and primary education with values, creativity, and community, we warmly invite you to become part of the KJA family. Your child’s learning journey starts here—with care and purpose.</p>



<div style="height:62px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="has-link-color wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph">To begin your child’s enrollment, simply <a href="http://84.247.190.131/apply/" data-type="page" data-id="235" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>click here to apply online</strong></a>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We can’t wait to welcome you to the KJA Najjanankumbi family!</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>', 'https://kja.ug/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/1727089774430-DSC_0926-2-1.jpg', 'The Kampala Junior Academy – Najjanankumbi campus is our other blended nursery and primary school, located on serene Kaggwa Road off Kampala-Entebbe Road, just after Masanyalaze. It offers a warm and nurturing environment where young learners grow and thrive.'),
  ('kitante', 'Kitante', 'The Kampala Junior Academy – Kitante campus is our original home and the heart of the KJA story. Located along Yusuf Lule Road, just opposite the Golf Course, KJA Kitante continues to offer high-quality nursery school, daycare, and primary school education.', '<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At Kampala Junior Academy – Kitante, we believe in providing more than just an education. We offer a nurturing environment where children feel safe, inspired, and supported to be their very best. From strong academics and vibrant co-curriculars to a caring community and a secure, scenic campus — everything at KJA is designed with your child’s growth in mind. If you''re looking for a school that combines quality <strong>NURSERY</strong>, and <strong>PRIMARY</strong> School Education with values, creativity, and community, we warmly invite you to become part of the KJA family. Your child’s learning journey starts here—with care and purpose.</p>



<div style="height:46px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p class="has-link-color wp-elements-4 wp-block-paragraph">To begin your child’s enrollment, simply <a href="http://84.247.190.131/apply/" data-type="page" data-id="235" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>click here to apply online</strong></a>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We can’t wait to welcome you to the KJA Kitante family!</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>', 'https://kja.ug/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IMG-20251020-WA0192.jpg', 'The Kampala Junior Academy – Kitante campus is our original home and the heart of the KJA story. Located along Yusuf Lule Road, just opposite the Golf Course, KJA Kitante continues to offer high-quality nursery school, daycare, and primary school education.');


